sentences.text:
Upon the bare perusal of the records of this case, it  is crystal clear that initial notification has been made on  03.06.2021 and objection has admittedly filed on 09.06.2021 but respondent Collector sat over the matter,
whereas the contention of law under Section 15 of the Act of 2013 are as follows:
"15. Hearing of objections.-(1) Any person interested in any land which has been notified under sub-section (1) of Section 11, as being required or likely to be required for a public purpose, may within sixty days from the date of the publication of the preliminary notification, object to-- (a) the area and suitability of land proposed to be acquired;
(b) justification offered for public purpose;
Patna High Court CWJC No.8570 of 2022 dt.18-07-2023 (c) the findings of the Social Impact Assessment report.

